<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were steady.</p>
<p>Steers - load choice and prime y.g. 2-3 1350 lbs exotics</p>
<p>68.50. Select to mostly choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 66.50-68.00.</p>
<p>Select 63.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - largely choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 66.00-68.00.</p>
<p>Select 62.00-66.50.</p>
</text>
